      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.297133207321167
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The complainant expressed her  inability to fulfill the demand on account of financial status of her father.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1600,
      "end": 1708,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24962659180164337
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The accused ill-treated her, she was assaulted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1709,
      "end": 1758,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28090202808380127
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "In May 2020, Respondent  No.2 left the matrimonial home and went to her parents.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1759,
      "end": 1839,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2821631133556366
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "In September  2020, the accused visited the complainant and assured that she will not  be ill-treated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1840,
      "end": 1942,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26405683159828186
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "She returned to matrimonial home in September 2020.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1943,
      "end": 1994,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2822136878967285
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The husband of complainant occupied the premises on leave and licence  basis and both of them started residing together.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1995,
      "end": 2117,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27895283699035645
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The harassment at the  instance of her husband continued.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2118,
      "end": 2175,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2354533076286316
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "She was assaulted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2176,
      "end": 2194,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2775816023349762
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "The husband of  her sister-in-law visited the house of the complainant in October 2020  and subjected her to sexual assault.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2195,
      "end": 2319,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28052350878715515
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "He repeatedly visited her house  when her husband was not there and forcefully subjected her to sexual  assault.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2320,
      "end": 2432,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28526970744132996
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "She conceived.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2433,
      "end": 2447,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2852916717529297
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "She was forced to terminate her pregnancy.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2448,
      "end": 2490,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3367955982685089
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "In  June 2021, the complainant received notice intimating her that she  should remain present in Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2491,
      "end": 2594,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3124350905418396
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "Accused No.1 (husband) had filed the  Petition for divorce.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2595,
      "end": 2654,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3322466313838959
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "He had installed the camera in the bedroom and  produced evidence in divorce proceedings against complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2655,
      "end": 2764,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24912947416305542
    },
